[11:35:10.290] CORE EXPERIMENT - C objects -> virtual addresses (README 九)
[11:35:10.290] ======================================================================
[11:35:10.290] PIE + ASLR randomize ABSOLUTE addresses, but the relative layout
[11:35:10.290] (text/rodata/data/bss < heap < mmap < stack) is preserved.
[11:35:10.290] Compare 'machine' and address widths across x86-64 and ARM64 logs.
